All rules, coding guidelines, commands, and architecture specifications for this repository are defined in AGENTS.md.

Always follow AGENTS.md.
When updating according to new open source commits or ignoring an upstream commit:
- Run `pnpm upstream:sync` (or `pnpm upstream:sync <sha>`)
- Run `pnpm upstream:ignore <sha>`
- The baseline is in `src/upstream.json` and auto-synchronized by CI.
